aults, or conditional defaults for both fields and for form control HTML attributes. A notable extension, included here, is displaying different label and help text for address form fields to adjust between assuming a local country postal format vs. a more international format while adding a country field (but only when needed). ","topics":[],"score":260456,"global_rank":50853},{"name":"richford/personal-website-source","owner":"richford","html_url":"https://github.com/richford/personal-website-source","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Source code for my personal website. Built with Pelican.","topics":[],"score":260452,"global_rank":50858},{"name":"k8thekat/Advent-of-Code","owner":"k8thekat","html_url":"https://github.com/k8thekat/Advent-of-Code","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Advent of Code Yearly Challenge","topics":[],"score":260449,"global_rank":50863},{"name":"pmarches/CHC1203-canbus","owner":"pmarches","html_url":"https://github.com/pmarches/CHC1203-canbus","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Code and documentation about Quick's CHC1203 chain counter. ","topics":[],"score":260440,"global_rank":50867},{"name":"AllenInstitute/ophys_ephys_comparison_paper","owner":"AllenInstitute","html_url":"https://github.com/AllenInstitute/ophys_ephys_comparison_paper","stars":1,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Code for generating figures from Siegle, Ledochowitsch et al. (2021) eLife","topics":[],"score":260434,"global_rank":50872},{"name":"deysuman/machine-learning","owner":"deysuman","html_url":"https://github.com/deysuman/machine-learning","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Nural networks","topics":["python","pytorch"],"score":260429,"global_rank":50879},{"name":"RajanJS/DAP","owner":"RajanJS","html_url":"https://github.com/RajanJS/DAP","stars":0,"forks":0,"wat